#!args --verify-dirty --open apps/JFNetworker/tests/fixtures/hw_basic.jfnet
# the hardware of a device in the window (inspector/hardware.rs, metrics.rs) on
# tests/fixtures/hw_basic.jfnet: "Hardware simulieren" on the project's page with its line and one undo
# step; a host's card with the figures of its model marked as assumptions; a preset; a refused figure;
# a resize with its reboot and its mark, one live; undo; a device with figures of its own; the fault card's
# slower CPU and memory hog; the Hardware row of the Metriken panel with its tiles and charts.  The
# numbers are those of this run on the virtual clock.
# Ids: the switch 139264; the card: own 139265, preset 139266, cores 139267, speed 139268, RAM 139269,
# swap 139270, disk 139271, its kind 139272, live 139273, the model's figures 139274, apply 139275; the
# faults: factor 139280, slow down 139281, GiB 139282, occupy 139283; the Metriken tree 47104
size 1280 2600
theme light
# ---- the project's page: on (the file says so), its line, one undo step
expect #139264 checked
expect text:"Server und Hosts bekommen CPU und RAM ihres Modells: Dienste warten auf freie Kerne, zu wenig Speicher bremst sie. Aus: Rechenzeit kostet nichts, wie bisher." exists
click #139264
wait 100
expect #139264 unchecked
key ctrl+z
wait 100
expect #139264 checked
key ctrl+y
wait 100
expect #139264 unchecked
key ctrl+z
wait 3000
# ---- WEB1: the figures of its model, assumptions, and that it says so
click listitem:"WEB1"
wait 100
expect text:"Hardware" exists
expect text:"Annahmen für dieses Modell, keine Messwerte eines echten Geräts." exists
expect #139267 text "4"
expect #139268 text "110"
expect #139269 text "16"
expect #139270 text "2"
expect #139271 text "480"
expect text:"Das Gerät startet dafür neu und fällt 30 s aus; was auf der Disk liegt, bleibt." exists
expect #139274 missing
# a figure that cannot be: refused, nothing changes
click #139267
key ctrl+a
type "0"
click #139275
wait 100
expect text:"Die Zahl der Kerne geht von 1 bis 1024." exists
# ---- a resize: a reboot, its mark, one undo step
click #139267
key ctrl+a
type "8"
click #139275
wait 100
expect text:"Eigene Angaben." exists
expect #139267 text "8"
expect #139274 exists
expect text:"Fehler 1: WEB1 startet für neue Hardware neu" exists
key ctrl+z
wait 100
expect text:"Annahmen für dieses Modell, keine Messwerte eines echten Geräts." exists
expect #139267 text "4"
key ctrl+y
wait 100
expect #139267 text "8"
# ---- live: no new mark, no reboot; it says so before it happens
click #139273
wait 100
expect text:"Die neuen Werte gelten sofort, ohne Neustart." exists
click #139267
key ctrl+a
type "16"
click #139275
wait 100
expect #139267 text "16"
# ---- back to the model's figures
click #139274
wait 100
expect text:"Annahmen für dieses Modell, keine Messwerte eines echten Geräts." exists
expect #139267 text "4"
# ---- WEB2 has its own figures, from the start
click listitem:"WEB2"
wait 100
expect text:"Eigene Angaben." exists
expect #139267 text "1"
expect #139269 text "1"
# ---- the faults of a device with hardware
click #139280
type "3"
click #139281
wait 100
expect text:"Fehler 2: CPU von WEB2 langsam: Rechenzeit ×3" exists
click #139282
type "0"
click #139283
wait 100
expect text:"Der Speicher ist eine Zahl von GiB größer als 0, z. B. 8." exists
click #139282
key ctrl+a
type "0,5"
click #139283
wait 100
expect text:"Fehler 3: Speicherfresser auf WEB2: 512 MiB" exists
# ---- the Metriken panel: a row of its own, after the services
wait 4000
key ctrl+shift+m
wait 100
click #47113
wait 100
expect text:"WEB2 · Hardware" exists
expect text:"1 Kern, 1 GiB RAM, Festplatte 500 GiB" exists
shot build/jfnetworker/hardware_panel.png
